      en: ["The Titas Gas Field, discovered in 1962, is one of the most important energy sources in Bangladesh.", "Ustad Alauddin Khan, the legendary musician, was born in Shibpur village of this district in 1862.", "Brahmanbaria was upgraded from a subdivision to a full district in 1984.", "The Ashuganj Fertilizer Factory, one of the largest in the country, is located within the district.", "The Titas River is famous for the annual boat racing festival (Nouka Baich) held during the monsoon.", "The city is a major hub for the production of hand-rolled cigars and traditional textile products."],
